  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive). Pair: ⟦{立|た}つ→立つ：00758_tatsu⟧ (intransitive, to stand). Pattern: X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{立|た}てる (stand X up / make X).\n\nASPECT: て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates resulting state. ⟦{立|た}て→立つ：00758_tatsu⟧て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ = 'has set up' or 'is standing (something).'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{計画|けいかく}→計画：01172_keikaku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{立|た}てる (make a plan)\n- ⟦{予定|よてい}→予定：00824_yotei⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{立|た}てる (make a schedule)\n- ⟦{目標|もくひょう}→目標：03631_mokuhyou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{立|た}てる (set a goal)\n- ⟦{音|おと}→音：00743_oto⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{立|た}てる (make a sound)\n- ⟦{旗|はた}→旗：02161_hata⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{立|た}てる (raise a flag)\n- ⟦{腹|はら}→腹：02165_hara⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{立|た}てる (get angry)\n\nHOMOPHONE: Don't confuse with ⟦{建|た}てる→建てる：01189_tateru⟧ (to build), which has the same reading.\n- {立|た}てる (立): to stand up, erect (general)\n- ⟦{建|た}てる→建てる：01189_tateru⟧ (建): to build (structures)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {立|た}てる (transitive): stand X up\n- ⟦{立|た}つ→立つ：00758_tatsu⟧ (intransitive): X stands",
